      "Summary": {
        "Namespace": "",
        "Key": "7BBF143748E357ACEDE84F980230A752",
        "SourceString": "Met Sal Maia, a desperate tavern keeper from the poorer quarter, bitter over Viceroy Kug’s grand banquet while hunger clings to the streets. They spoke of a shipment of exotic foods bound for the nobles and suggested “redistributing” it to those starving. They asked me to bring the matter before the Mayor, though they seemed doubtful it would help their plight.",
